# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sentinel Workspace — curated seed repo
#
# This repo is NOT a dump of the local workspace.
#   scratch/   → throwaway experiments + archived legacy. Never tracked.
#   modules/   → temporary authoring only; the public seed ships no root Modules.
#   projects/  → saved work plus each project's bundled Module dependencies.
# New projects remain visible to Git. The release audit owns the exact shipped set.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Generated / local artifacts ──────────────────────────────
captures/
**/captures/
refs/
vision.json
*.previous
projects/recovery_*.sentinel
# per-project proof bundles are point-in-time artifacts, regenerated on demand
projects/*/proof/
*.log
# compiled shader caches (regenerated on load; build/GPU-specific)
**/shader_cache/
# Python caches are regenerated locally.
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# scratch: throwaway experiments + archived legacy modules. Never shipped.
scratch/

# ── Root Modules ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root modules are not ignored so temporary scaffolds remain visible. Bundle
# finished work under projects/<project>/modules/, then remove the root copy.
# Release validation rejects every tracked or filesystem root Module.

# ── Curated projects ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Projects are not ignored. This keeps ordinary agent-created work visible in
# `git status`; release validation rejects anything outside the curated set.

# Module shader caches are compiled artifacts, rebuilt on load
**/.sentinel/shader_cache/
